{"synopsis":"Seekor ular tua di desa secara tidak sengaja memakan pil manusia, membangkitkan kecerdasan spiritualnya. Sejak saat itu, ia memulai jalur kultivasi. Dalam rentang waktu satu dekade yang singkat, ular itu, yang tidak gentar oleh berlalunya waktu, memanfaatkan setiap momen. Ini adalah kisah tentang seekor ular tua yang menjadi abadi.","alternative_title":"Snake Immortal: The Tale of a Snake’s Cultivation to Immortality","author":"","artist":"","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"8cf8947f-9ac4-44e7-96ac-0cada159cd37","number":"98","chapter":"98","title":"Chapter 98","date":"2026-08-01","released":"2026-08-01","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"b7c3fc2a-f930-4dbe-9f2a-eb19d262c400","number":"97","chapter":"97","title":"Chapter 97","date":"2026-07-27","released":"2026-07-27","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"704d181f-a064-4c34-817d-825441e0c899","number":"96","chapter":"96","title":"Chapter 96","date":"2026-07-20","released":"2026-07-20","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"e39f551d-63b2-494a-962e-3bb41257c836","number":"95","chapter":"95","title":"Chapter 95","date":"2026-07-13","released":"2026-07-13","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"eb2dba2b-4c13-4828-844c-4d3e0e908753","number":"94","chapter":"94","title":"Chapter 94","date":"2026-07-06","released":"2026-07-06","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"fe0f626b-252a-40f9-928b-a1ce5bb5cf8e","number":"93","chapter":"93","title":"Chapter 93","date":"2026-06-28","released":"2026-06-28","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"1470fa89-789b-4de2-896a-67ab753e66d2","number":"92","chapter":"92","title":"Chapter 92","date":"2026-06-22","released":"2026-06-22","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"afd8404c-8c42-439c-a874-f0fbf9c0c234","number":"91","chapter":"91","title":"Chapter 91","date":"2026-06-14","released":"2026-06-14","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"f5caf23c-cc6a-44b4-8791-13ef954559e1","number":"90","chapter":"90","title":"Chapter 90","date":"2026-06-06","released":"2026-06-06","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"5fab37ac-5b85-4d09-9cd0-e8fec34c7a68","number":"89","chapter":"89","title"